# The service image's direct dependencies (Day 12): no torch, xgboost or training libraries.
# The Dockerfile installs these with requirements.txt as a constraints file, so every version,
# transitive ones included, is the one pinned for the rest of the project.
fastapi
uvicorn
uvloop  # uvicorn picks these up on its own: ~35% more /reserve throughput (Day 13, findings 48)
httptools
redis
onnxruntime
tokenizers
numpy
pandas
